WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.480
Gainos.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.060
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:10.180
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.560
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.490
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.830
Warriors who wish to participate in Queen's Blade:

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.500
Prove your skills as warriors, here in this place!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.170
The warrior: Chivalrous Thief of the Wasteland, Risty...

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.590
will face Lightning General Claudette!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.880
Let Queen's Blade commence!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.770
It's quite a surprise to meet you in a place like this.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.610
Are you planning on running away again, thief?

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.350
Of course not.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.660
I am going to defeat you here!

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.500
Don't make me laugh.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.340
Shit, the paralysis poison...

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.920
That snake woman gave me quite a present before I left.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.510
Careless.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:17.180
You're finished!

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:29.980
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:29.980
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:29.980
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:38.700
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:38.700
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:38.700
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.700
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.700
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.700
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:55.250 --> 00:02:01.220
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:55.250 --> 00:02:01.220
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:55.250 --> 00:02:01.220
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:06.890
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:06.890
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:06.890
It is now my wish to become strong

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:13.520
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:13.520
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:13.520
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:19.690
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:19.690
答えを知りたい

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:19.690
I want to know the answer

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.580
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.580
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.580
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:32.830
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:32.830
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:32.830
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.010
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.010
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.010
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:49.110
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:49.110
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:49.110
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:06.120
Risty!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.580
Risty-san, hang in there.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.880
Thank goodness, there's still some left.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.170
The secret forest elf medicine?

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.470
Yes.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.430
Don't worry, she'll recover in no time.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.440
Take your sword, Leina.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.900
Tomoe, please handle the rest.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.740
Understood.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.870
Claudette.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.910
I challenge you to Queen's Blade!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.320
That's how it should be!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.380
A predestined fight between sisters, huh...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.090
It feels kind of good!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.820
Leina?

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.720
Claudette, why?

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.850
Elina-sama!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:17.560
Geez, you went on ahead of me! How mean!

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.090
I won't lose!

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:32.080
Never!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.880
I understand that Onee-sama is very strong.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.260
But... I'll never know unless I try!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.930
Hey, why aren't you fighting back?

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.190
This isn't enjoyable at all!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:09.660
<i>She is observing, to find out how strong Leina has become.</i>

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:17.260
Well, it looks like Leina's swordsmanship isn't so great after all.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.380
Her opponent is not a rookie, after all.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:24.800
Lightning General Claudette is one of the strongest warriors of the mainland.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:28.220
And the General's sword, Thunder Clap,

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.850
is a demonic sword that was forged for her by Owen and myself.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:41.650
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:43.360
You're too weak.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.660
What have you gained by throwing away your status as the heiress?

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.460
Freedom?

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.880
Just what has changed?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.770
Don't be so full of yourself!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.810
Nothing has changed at all!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.280
You are still the same as back then...

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.540
Why?

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.420
Why did you let that bird go?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.880
Because that bird has grown up.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:54.180
Sooner or later, it would have had to stand and survive on its own.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.060
But being all alone is just too sad.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:00.980
I know!

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.650
I'll tell father for you!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.240
Father will surely think of something-

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:08.820
Futile!

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.200
Come here, Leina.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.910
Father!

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:22.370
I've always wished for you to meet her. This is your sister, Claudette.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.710
My sister?

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:28.960
From today onwards, she will be living with us in the castle.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:32.970
Claudette, from today onwards, Leina will be your master.

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.220
Understood?

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:36.850
Yes.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.600
Onee-sama, I'm Leina.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:46.860
I'm so happy. I've always wanted a sister.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.820
Right now, you're still the same as you were before. Nothing has changed.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:59.440
You still don't understand the meaning of your responsibilities or position.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:00.040
I...

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:00.950
Shut up!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.290
I've always... I've always despised that part of you.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.300
Make sure nothing happens to it on your way back to the Count.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:26.060
Giving up so easily isn't really my style.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:32.150
But you know... seeing that child... makes me wet.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.410
You always hated me... That can't be...

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:45.130
Aren't you the one who's always been there to protect me?

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:47.170
Only because that was my duty.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.880
Duty...?

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.230
Did you really think it was because we were sisters?

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.140
We are not even related by blood.

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:05.240
Everything was for the sake of the Count.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:09.810
That's why I put away my frustrations, and continued with my duty to protect you.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:10.520
That's a lie!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:17.990
I don't believe it. I have always looked up to you as a prudent and strong sister!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.070
It looks like you still don't understand.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.410
The way you talk is far too naive.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:27.300
Running away from home with no remorse, despite being the heiress to the Count.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.190
I cannot forgive you for that.{fade}

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:32.520
That's right, you don't know anything.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.920
It's always been that way.

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:35.960
Claudette.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.430
Onee-sama?

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.390
This birdy is from that time...

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:54.570
Thank goodness, it's still alive.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:58.700
I'll bring you to a warm place right away, okay?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.670
Onee-sama?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.250
Its wings are broken.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.060
It will no longer be able to fly.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.950
You don't want to save it? Why not?

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.870
If it has already lost the ability to fly freely, what is the point of it living any longer?

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.540
Wait!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:16.170
But it's still alive. It's still alive, you know!

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.760
So...

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:22.300
It can do nothing but quietly accept its fate.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.930
That is its destiny.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.870
It seems that you still don't understand...

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:34.690
all the loneliness and pain which a person with responsibility bears.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.900
Onee-sama...

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.090
This is where the talking stops.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.450
Now, stand!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.420
Even so, I have always regarded you as my sister.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.750
For the country, for the citizens...

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:59.300
You would follow Father's instructions and complete your tasks.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.380
But I couldn't live like that.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.680
That's why I left the castle.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.180
And then I found them.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.430
The things I want to do for myself.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.820
The things I've learned from everyone.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:28.330
Rana, please watch Leina-san's battle closely.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:33.660
Now, show that pig-headed general for everyone to see

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:38.210
just how much you have grown from your ignorant and wild self.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:42.060
Everyone should bear their responsibilities from the day they are born.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.430
I cannot forgive those who run away from them!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.930
Ah, are they finally getting fired up?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:54.390
Love and hate, older sister and younger sister, a bloody battle of love between two siblings!

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:57.360
This is not something as lowly as that!

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.960
This is a true battle between two warriors.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:04.030
In order for them to understand each other's philosophy in life.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.870
I...

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:15.880
She didn't... run away.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.710
Risty-san, are your wounds okay?

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.130
As expected of the female ape!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.270
No matter the time or place, she always approaches everything seriously.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.470
This is Leina's way of doing things.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.810
It looks like I owe her one this time.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.560
Leina-san will become stronger and stronger.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:39.480
And finally, one day, I will fight together with her...

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.660
While traveling on this journey, I realized...

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:57.540
There are many types of strength.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:03.840
That's why, in my own way, I have to use all the power I have to help people.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.350
She slashed the lightning!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:20.070
Leina-san's sword and Thunder Clap were made using the same materials.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:25.530
That's why it is capable of blocking the General's lightning.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:31.240
However, doing this requires a high level of skill.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.290
<i>I learned it from everyone.</i>

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.920
<i>Bravery that surpasses belief.</i>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.350
<i>The strength to follow my own will.</i>

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:59.270
<i>And... the will to never get discouraged!</i>

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:07.530
Amazing.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:10.350
<i>That is Leina-san's true strength.</i>

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.620
<i>She is a bit clumsy, but she always moves forward while being true to her heart.</i>

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:19.460
<i>And she possesses a power that changes the people around her.</i>

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.850
Go!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:42.250
That is?

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.560
Dragon Tail!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.040
It was no good?

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:06.920
What?

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.040
Leina!

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:39.120
Look, Onee-sama!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.630
Sorry about that.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.470
Look, she got better!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.550
I fed her properly.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.000
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.520
Onee-sama?

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.390
I believe I said it before.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:05.850
Do not bring misery to her for your own satisfaction.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:08.520
But, look.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.410
She is very happy.

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.830
If Onee-sama would hug her a bit, I'm sure she'd be even happier.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.600
<i>I wanted to become strong.</i>

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:30.380
<i>Ever since I set foot in that castle, that was the only thought on my mind.</i>

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:35.530
<i>But Leina's existence shook my determination.</i>

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.430
<i>That's why I hated her...</i>

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.650
You can let go, Onee-sama.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.160
This time, I definitely won't let go.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.160
<i>I finally understand now.</i>

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.040
<i>Leina possesses a different kind of strength than I do.</i>

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.060
Onee-sama.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.170
You saved me once again.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:28.470
It's all over my face!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:33.150
Geez, Queen's Blade has ended, too.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:37.550
A tie? You guys need to determine the real winner!

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:41.960
Also, what the hell is with this sappy ending?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.290
That's why I hate female apes.

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.080
This is okay, right?

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.370
Yeah, probably.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.680
I found you, Leina!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:02.850
Elina!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.350
Onee-chan!

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.020
Elina!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.860
Ah! Don't look!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:24.540
Onee-chan's breasts belong only to me!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.660
Hey, Elina, what's gotten into you?

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:26.660
How shameless!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:30.250
Leina, I came here personally to pick you up.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.840
Let's hurry and return to the castle.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:36.440
Elina, I still have things I need to do.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.590
Eh? There's something more important than me?

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:44.100
Leina and I will participate in Queen's Blade.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.720
Onee-sama, too?

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.060
Then maybe I'll participate, too.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.310
Elina, you too?

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.190
Because...

00:18:54.570 --> 00:19:00.030
How could I possibly let my Onee-chan participate in this tournament with these barbarians all by herself?

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.660
I will protect you.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:08.290
Let her do what she wants. She said herself that she wants to participate.

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:11.300
Anyways, it's about time that we depart on our journey.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.250
Towards the Queen's capital.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.010
Something is coming, Ru.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:32.690
I have a very, very bad feeling about this.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.290
That's the phantom army!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.450
The Swamp Witch's underlings?

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:47.740
That's all you have to say, Melfa?

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.620
Is this alright, Your Highness?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:57.000
Something of this level... just let it go.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.320
Please pardon my rudeness, but...

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:03.280
The Swamp Witch's target is Queen's Blade, without a doubt.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:07.050
The phantom army's advances cannot be stopped without taking action.

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:11.720
Is that so?

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.140
Up ahead is the Queen's capital, Gainos.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.070
The next Queen will be determined here, right?

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:31.380
And how do we determine who becomes the Queen?

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:36.960
Who knows? Anyways, all we have to do now is keep on winning, right?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.910
Will things be that easy?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:42.560
Across this door, maybe the next Queen has already been decided...

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:45.010
Is.. is that true?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.090
Leina-san, let us begin Queen's Blade.

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.660
Right now, hurry!

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.240
You're too nervous.

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:54.770
To think that I could lose my composure...

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.860
You all seem to be having a good time.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.240
But too bad.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.350
No one will be able to pass through this door.

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:09.370
Because all of you will die here.

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:11.700
You again, monster?

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:29.800
Now, let's begin the massacre of the Queen's Blade warriors.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:38.320
Leina, I will kill you with my own hands.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
I can't express my overflowing feelings well.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
itsuka konna mainichi ga

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
いつかこんな毎日が

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
Until one day, when this every day life

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
natsukashiku naru hi ga kuru made wa

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
懐かしくなる日が来るまでは

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
Becomes a memory I would look back at

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
itsumo kokoro no katasumi ni

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
いつも心の片隅に

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
I would like to keep it locked away

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
shizuka ni shimatte okitai

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
静かにしまっておきたい

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
In the quiet corner of my heart.

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
yakusoku nante chiisa na ki yasume

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
約束なんて小さな気休め

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
Promises are but consolations.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
ashita o mukaeru tame ni tsuita

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
明日を迎えるためについた

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
They may very well be,

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
yasashii uso kamoshirenai

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
優しい嘘かもしれない

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
Simple lies to face tomorrow.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
shinjiteru kara ano hi no koto

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
信じてるからあの日のこと

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
I'll continue to believe in the day we made our promise,

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
No matter how much time passes by,

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
ima no watashi wo sasaeteru taisetsu na mono

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
今の私を支えてる大切なもの

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
It is my wish to tell you everything.

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:15.820
Now, now, prepare for battle.

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:19.540
Nanael and the gang finally arrive at the Queen's capital, Gainos.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:24.620
However, the trio who was assigned the role of blocking their way has appeared with the phantom army.

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:27.960
But you guys always lose. It's not always about numbers, right?

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.880
Nanael is very fond of her own intelligence.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.520
She is elegant in appearance, and swift with killing blows.

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:34.760
Possessing fierce swordsmanship that has won many battles.

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:38.390
And in the final episode, she will make all of you her slaves!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.810
Next time: The Open Door ~ Path to the Queen!

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:43.400
Huh, the Queen is setting us up?
